%% Flujo 1: Ingesta de Datos de Consumo en Tiempo Real
sequenceDiagram
    participant IoT as 📱 IoT Device
    participant ConAPI as 🔵 Consumption API
    participant Celery as ⏱️ Celery Task
    participant MongoDB as 🗄️ MongoDB
    participant Redis as 🔴 Redis

    IoT->>ConAPI: POST /ingest<br/>{household_id, consumption_kwh}
    ConAPI->>ConAPI: Valida JWT token<br/>(via Keycloak)
    ConAPI->>Redis: Enqueue task
    ConAPI-->>IoT: 202 Accepted
    Celery->>Redis: Consume task
    Celery->>MongoDB: Insert consumption_readings
    MongoDB-->>Celery: ✓ Stored
    Note over Celery,MongoDB: Procesamiento asincrónico

---

%% Flujo 2: Visualización de Dashboards
sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 👤 Usuario
    participant Frontend as 🌐 Frontend (Angular)
    participant InsightsAPI as 🟢 Insights API
    participant ConAPI as 🔵 Consumption API
    participant PredictionAPI as 🟡 Prediction API
    participant TariffAPI as 🟣 Tariff API

    User->>Frontend: Abre dashboard
    Frontend->>InsightsAPI: GET /api/v1/dashboard/summary
    InsightsAPI->>ConAPI: GET /api/v1/consumption/current
    ConAPI-->>InsightsAPI: {consumption: 5.2kW}
    InsightsAPI->>PredictionAPI: POST /predict<br/>{household_id}
    PredictionAPI-->>InsightsAPI: {prediction: 250kWh/mes}
    InsightsAPI->>TariffAPI: GET /tariffs
    TariffAPI-->>InsightsAPI: {cost_per_kwh: 0.142}
    InsightsAPI->>InsightsAPI: Aggregate & calculate
    InsightsAPI-->>Frontend: {summary, charts,<br/>recommendations}
    Frontend->>Frontend: Render charts
    Frontend-->>User: ✓ Dashboard actualizado

---

%% Flujo 3: Registro y Predicción de Electrodomésticos
sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 👤 Usuario
    participant Frontend as 🌐 Frontend
    participant AppAPI as 🟠 Appliances API
    participant PredictionAPI as 🟡 Prediction API
    participant ConAPI as 🔵 Consumption API
    participant PostgreSQL as 🗄️ PostgreSQL

    User->>Frontend: Registra AC (5000W)
    Frontend->>AppAPI: POST /api/v1/appliances<br/>{type: "AC", power: 5000}
    AppAPI->>AppAPI: Clasifica dispositivo
    AppAPI->>ConAPI: GET /api/v1/consumption/historical<br/>{last_30_days}
    ConAPI-->>AppAPI: {consumption_history}
    AppAPI->>PredictionAPI: POST /predict/monthly<br/>{appliance_data,<br/>historical_consumption}
    PredictionAPI->>PredictionAPI: Ejecuta ML Model
    PredictionAPI-->>AppAPI: {prediction: 150kWh/mes,<br/>confidence: 0.92}
    AppAPI->>PostgreSQL: INSERT appliances
    PostgreSQL-->>AppAPI: ✓ Stored
    AppAPI-->>Frontend: {appliance_id, prediction,<br/>cost_projection: $21.30}
    Frontend-->>User: ✓ AC registrado

---

%% Flujo 4: Autenticación con Keycloak
sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 👤 Usuario
    participant Frontend as 🌐 Frontend
    participant Keycloak as 🔐 Keycloak
    participant ConAPI as 🔵 Consumption API
    participant InsightsAPI as 🟢 Insights API

    User->>Frontend: Ingresa credenciales
    Frontend->>Keycloak: POST /auth<br/>{username, password}
    Keycloak-->>Frontend: {access_token, refresh_token}
    Frontend->>Frontend: Almacena token
    Frontend->>ConAPI: GET /api/v1/consumption<br/>Authorization: Bearer {token}
    ConAPI->>Keycloak: Valida token
    Keycloak-->>ConAPI: ✓ Valid
    ConAPI-->>Frontend: {consumption_data}
    Frontend-->>User: ✓ Autenticado

---

%% Flujo 5: Recomendaciones de Ahorro (Futuro)
sequenceDiagram
    participant InsightsAPI as 🟢 Insights API
    participant ConAPI as 🔵 Consumption API
    participant AppAPI as 🟠 Appliances API
    participant PredictionAPI as 🟡 Prediction API

    InsightsAPI->>ConAPI: GET /consumption/pattern
    ConAPI-->>InsightsAPI: {high_consumption_hours: [18-21]}
    InsightsAPI->>AppAPI: GET /appliances/top-consumers<br/>{household_id}
    AppAPI-->>InsightsAPI: [{AC: 150kWh}, {Refrigerador: 120kWh}]
    InsightsAPI->>PredictionAPI: POST /recommendations<br/>{consumption_pattern, appliances}
    PredictionAPI-->>InsightsAPI: [{text: "Usar AC 2h menos",<br/>potential_savings: 10kWh}]
    Note over InsightsAPI,PredictionAPI: IA analiza patrones<br/>y genera recomendaciones

---

%% Flujo 6: Integración con Proveedor de Energía (Futuro)
sequenceDiagram
    participant Utility as ⚡ Empresa Energética
    participant TariffAPI as 🟣 Tariff API
    participant Insights as 🟢 Insights API
    participant User as 👤 Usuario

    Utility->>TariffAPI: POST /tariffs/update<br/>{new_rates}
    TariffAPI->>TariffAPI: Almacena tarifas
    TariffAPI->>Insights: Notificación tariff_updated
    Insights->>Insights: Recalcula costos
    Insights->>User: Alerta: "Cambio de tarifas"
    Note over TariffAPI,Insights: Sincronización en tiempo real

